        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n\n    actor Customer\n\n    participant Agent as Voice Agent\n    participant Graph as LangGraph\n    participant Memory\n    participant Embed as Embedding Service\n    participant Retriever\n    participant VectorDB as pgvector\n    participant Docs as Document Storage\n    participant Reranker\n    participant AI as LLM Provider\n    participant DB as PostgreSQL\n\n\n    Customer-&gt;&gt;Agent: Ask question\n\n    Agent-&gt;&gt;Graph: User query\n\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;Memory: Retrieve conversation context\n\n    Memory--&gt;&gt;Graph: Previous conversation state\n\n\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;Embed: Generate query embedding\n\n    Embed--&gt;&gt;Graph: Vector representation\n\n\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;Retriever: Search knowledge base\n\n    Retriever-&gt;&gt;VectorDB: Similarity search\n\n    VectorDB--&gt;&gt;Retriever: Relevant chunks\n\n\n    Retriever-&gt;&gt;Docs: Fetch source documents\n\n    Docs--&gt;&gt;Retriever: Document content\n\n\n    Retriever-&gt;&gt;Reranker: Rank retrieved results\n\n    Reranker--&gt;&gt;Graph: Best context passages\n\n\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;AI: Prompt + Context + Question\n\n    AI--&gt;&gt;Graph: Generated answer\n\n\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;Memory: Store interaction\n\n    Graph-&gt;&gt;DB: Save query and response\n\n\n    Graph--&gt;&gt;Agent: Final response\n\n    Agent--&gt;&gt;Customer: Answer&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="ySirkflwYDD05Z-J9VoX-1070">
